@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = 先随便写个占位

### 1. 测试注册 - 正常情况
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "neurotest",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 测试注册 - 重复注册 (应该报错)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "neurotest",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 测试登录 - 密码错误 (应该报错)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "neurotest",
  "password": "wrongpwd"
}

### 4. 测试登录 - 成功 (应该返回 Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "neurotest",
  "password": "123456"
}




### 5. 【未登录】尝试创建笔记 (应该被拦截报错)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试笔记",
  "content": "这是内容"
}

### 6. 新增笔记
POST http://localhost:8080/api/note
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "title": "我的第一篇神经笔记",
  "content": "Sa-Token 和 MyBatis-Plus 太好用了！"
}

### 7. 查询笔记
GET http://localhost:8080/api/note


### 8. 修改笔记 (改 id=16)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/note/17
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "我的第一篇神经笔记（已修改）",
  "content": "今天彻底搞定了 MyBatis-Plus 和 PG 的映射！",
  "tags": ["Java", "PG"]
}

### 9. 删除笔记 (软删除 id=15)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/note/19


### 10. 再次查询 (验证：15消失，16标题变了)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/note

